{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20265kDoLCf8WI1792846736.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>於馬鞍山上演的中國手球超級聯賽，港隊以9分不敵安徽。</p><p></p><p>黑衫港隊，去年全運會分組賽及四強都不敵最後亞軍得主安徽，今次半場落後11-17，有觀眾揮動旗幟，為港隊打氣。連潤滔攻入最高9分，不過未能協助球隊反先。</p><p></p><p>上場贏上海1分的港隊，今場輸21-30，周日對北京。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T14:02:02.257636+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T12:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T16:58:08.588766+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T13:58:21.444236+00:00","content_hash":"b7b80342c296baa94bd6e1445d5acdeea5c4a3c47d82a94319a60fddfb6a73e0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T14:02:02.257636+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}